f="/encyclopedia/antequera">Antequera</a> after a long siege</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1487</span><span class="rf-text">Málaga falls after a long siege and its people are enslaved</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1492</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/muhammad-xii-of-granada">Boabdil</a> surrenders <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/granada">Granada</a> to Isabella I and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-ii-of-aragon">Ferdinand II</a> on 2 January</span></li></ol>
